// "Anneau Guimauve": a ring of marshmallow in a pastry land (issue #36), redrawn after the guide «
// Conception des circuits » (issue #148, docs/GAME_DESIGN.md § 16). Original layout, about 1537 m a
// lap, turning right, on a ring of sugar 10 to 40 m above the pink fields (issue #223: 10 to 17 m
// before): the start straight; two hairpins (right, left) and the climb of the cake, a hairpin to
// the right at its top, a tight corner to the left; along the top, the risky jump's corner (a tight
// corner to the right, its inside a drop, that a ramp crosses); off the landing, a drop of 5 m; the
// lacets down the cake (a hairpin to the left, a hairpin to the right), the climb back and a tight
// corner to the right; the approach of the bulge and its bump; the bulge (its hidden road straight
// behind a stack of crates, while the road goes round); the last corner (its grass bridge behind a
// panel that breaks with a boost) and a bump before the grid. Six big turns (five hairpins and the
// bulge's S), four tight corners of 90°: no long soft curve, one long straight. The pieces of the
// shortcuts (the jump's corner and its landing; the bulge, the last corner and their paths) are the
// Coteau Citrouille's (the Corniche Cannelle's, issues #107, #156, #111), with other covers; the
// rest is new.
//
// Drawn as a plan of straights and arcs (hairpins of 22 m, tight corners of 18 m), its points every
// 8 m along it (the parameters below follow them).
//
// Format: see src/track/data.rs. Point 0 is the start line; karts drive toward point 1 (north, -Z),
// then turn right. The grid sits on the straight behind point 0.
(
    name: "Anneau Guimauve",
    // Dressing (issue #11): a pastry land (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), the same every time (seed),
    // and pieces placed by hand: gingerbread men at the start line (beyond the posts of its arch),
    // a giant birthday cake in the infield, giant donuts beside the start straight and the climb back.
    biome: "Guimauve",
    // Issue #104: its music (`assets/data/music.ron`).
    music: "sky-blue-street",
    decor_seed: 5,
    // Issue #211: the pastry land's terrain (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), and it hugs the road: the
    // ring of sugar, 10 to 40 m above the pink fields, stands on a bank of marshmallow that comes
    // up to its walls and falls away from them (`embank`, rise over run: about 31°), instead of the
    // skirts down to the flat fields. Issue #223: its hills 46 m high (30 before), above the top
    // of the cake. The voids stay (the jump's corner, the drop's foot: 6 m under
    // the road at least).
    terrain: (height: 46.0, scale: 140.0, cliffs: 0.3, terrace: 8.0, floor: 0.25,
              rock: (0.84, 0.56, 0.70), steep: 1.0, embank: 0.6),
    props: [
        (model: "holiday-kit/gingerbread-man", at: 0.0, side: Both, height: 3.5, radius: 1.2, gap: 1.8),
        (model: "food-kit/cake-birthday", at: 39.800, side: Right, height: 22.0, radius: 12.0, gap: 30.0),
        (model: "food-kit/donut-sprinkles", at: 4.000, side: Left, height: 14.0, radius: 7.0, gap: 6.0, yaw: 90.0),
        (model: "food-kit/donut-chocolate", at: 125.909, side: Left, height: 12.0, radius: 6.0, gap: 6.0, yaw: 90.0),
        // Issue #191: a giant lollipop in the middle of the bulge, as on the Coteau Citrouille
        // (its pine): 8 m from the wall, off the chase camera's sight lines out of the turn.
        (model: "food-kit/lollypop", at: 161.216, side: Right, height: 22.0, radius: 3.8, gap: 8.0),
    ],
    checkpoint_spacing: 25.0,
